{"3821080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Khachapuri", "steam_appid": 3821080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Khachapuri</strong> is a tiny, atmospheric first-person game. Here, you’ll prepare a delicious Khachapuri in a romantic setting and with some unexpectedly charming company. 🎷</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each ingredient has a personality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821080/extras/b85613c11ad5ba237e893fda2094fe8e.avif?t=1775934763\" width=780 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’ll happily help you and keep you company. Just please, treat them with care. 🙏</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Preparation is a process</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and Add 🥣</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop and Grate 🔪</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knead and Mash 🍞</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s next in the recipe ❔</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A charming guide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821080/extras/fde303bd7baf626fa4070677efa3f0b5.avif?t=1775934763\" width=780 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t know the recipe? No problem! A cheerful, fluffy bunch of parsley will guide you step by step with joy and warmth. Isn’t she a cutie? ☺️</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pleasant atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821080/extras/4f3b23d18aee15756ccf0e39978c09da.avif?t=1775934763\" width=780 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy apartment with mountain views. Evening sun rays. Vinyl jazz. Step inside. Relax. Make yourself at home. 🌇</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A lively apartment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to look around. There are funny, beautiful and interactive little surprises scattered throughout. Will you be able to find them all? 🔎</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A magical mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh yeah... it’s there... waiting. Will you unravel it? Only time will tell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Indie with love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tiny game was born from the hands of an equally tiny team, inspired by a Game Jam. It may be short, but it’s full of love, attention to detail and indie spirit. We hope you enjoy your time with it. 🥂</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Khachapuri</strong> is a tiny, atmospheric first-person game. Here, you’ll prepare a delicious Khachapuri in a romantic setting and with some unexpectedly charming company. 🎷</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each ingredient has a personality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821080/extras/b85613c11ad5ba237e893fda2094fe8e.avif?t=1775934763\" width=780 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’ll happily help you and keep you company. Just please, treat them with care. 🙏</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Preparation is a process</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and Add 🥣</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop and Grate 🔪</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knead and Mash 🍞</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s next in the recipe ❔</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A charming guide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821080/extras/fde303bd7baf626fa4070677efa3f0b5.avif?t=1775934763\" width=780 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t know the recipe? No problem! A cheerful, fluffy bunch of parsley will guide you step by step with joy and warmth. Isn’t she a cutie? ☺️</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pleasant atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821080/extras/4f3b23d18aee15756ccf0e39978c09da.avif?t=1775934763\" width=780 height=279 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy apartment with mountain views. Evening sun rays. Vinyl jazz. Step inside. Relax. Make yourself at home. 🌇</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A lively apartment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to look around. There are funny, beautiful and interactive little surprises scattered throughout. Will you be able to find them all? 🔎</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A magical mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh yeah... it’s there... waiting. Will you unravel it? Only time will tell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Indie with love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tiny game was born from the hands of an equally tiny team, inspired by a Game Jam. It may be short, but it’s full of love, attention to detail and indie spirit. We hope you enjoy your time with it. 🥂</p>", "short_description": "Sunset rays, Smooth Jazz, a Cozy place and Wine... How about making a romantic dinner with nice company, huh? Today you're preparing a Khachapuri! Come on! Take a bite of this short but yummy story.😋", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821080/3c61cfd79d4892195f36969f7c1702dece262d00/header.jpg?t=1775934763", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamst